# SOP 4.3 – Incident Notifications

Section 4 – Communications and Information Technology

*Draft v2.0, 30 August 2026. Not yet endorsed. Supersedes v1.1 (effective 23 December 2025) on endorsement.*

## Scope

To describe the procedure to be followed by applicable agency personnel in the notification of incidents where lifesaving services are involved, under the LIMSOC Incident Categorisation model.

